---
config:
  sequence:
    rightAngles: true
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 10 5
    participant Client
    box rgb(240, 230, 255)
        participant Api as API
        participant Jobs as Job runner
    end
    Client->>()Api: Central connection at the end
    Client()->>Api: Central connection at the start
    Client()->>()Api: Both ends
    Client-|\Api: Solid half arrow
    Api--|/Client: Dotted half arrow
    Client-\\Api: Barb
    Client/|-Api: Half arrow at the start
    autonumber off
    Api->>Api: Self-message at right angles
    autonumber
    create participant Cache
    Api->>Cache: Warm up
    par_over Fan out
        Api->>Jobs: Queue the report
    and
        Api->>Cache: Store the report
    end
    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Jobs-->>Api: Report ready
    end
    rect
        Api-->>Client: Report link
    end
    Note left of Client: Left of one
    Note right of Cache: Right of one
    Note over Jobs: Over one
    Note over Client,Api: Over two
    destroy Cache
    Api-xCache: Evict
